msgstr "Trenebla Elŝuta Dosiera piktogramo"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.90.md:48
msgid "Low Bluetooth Battery"
msgstr "Malalta Bluetooth-Baterio"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.90.md:48
msgid "Bluetooth Device Battery Low Notification"
msgstr "Bluetooth-Aparato Baterio Malalta Sciigo"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.90.md:50
msgid ""
"The timeout indicator on notification popups has been made circular and "
"surrounds the close button"
msgstr ""
"La tempofinindikilo sur sciigaj ŝprucfenestroj fariĝis cirkla kaj ĉirkaŭas "
"la fermbutonon"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.90.md:51
msgid ""
"A draggable icon in the \"file downloaded\" notification has been added, so "
"you can quickly drag it to places"
msgstr ""
"Trenebla piktogramo en la sciigo \"dosiero elŝutita\" estis aldonita, do vi "
"povas rapide treni ĝin al lokoj"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.17.90.md:52
msgid ""
"Plasma now shows you a notification warning when a connected Bluetooth "
"device is about to run out of power"
msgstr ""
"Plasmo nun montras al vi sciigan averton kiam konektita Bluetooth-aparato "
"estas elĉerpiĝos"

