"nm/42806c6c82511b705a204334cab4c52c66a9f8b9\">Enmeto.</a>"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.4.md:12
msgid ""
"Only open KCM in systemsettings if it can be displayed. <a href=\"https://"
"commits.kde.org/plasma-workspace/5bc6d83ae083632fa4eef21a03b1ef59dd9a852e"
"\">Commit.</a> Fixes bug <a href=\"https://bugs.kde.org/423612\">#423612</a>"
msgstr ""
"Malfermu KCM nur en sistemaj agordoj se ĝi povas esti montrita. <a href="
"\"https://commits.kde.org/plasma-"
"workspace/5bc6d83ae083632fa4eef21a03b1ef59dd9a852e\">Enmeto.</a> Korektas "
"cimon <a href=\"https://bugs.kde.org/423612\">#423612</a>"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.4.md:13
msgid ""
"Plasma Vault: Reset password field when the user clicks Ok. <a href="
"\"https://commits.kde.org/plasma-"
"vault/5e6a53ba55fd60ace3adbd4ca57f90a5cd44992f\">Commit.</a> Fixes bug <a "
"href=\"https://bugs.kde.org/424063\">#424063</a>"
msgstr ""
"Plasma Vault: Restarigi pasvortan kampon kiam la uzanto alklakas Ok. <a href="
"\"https://commits.kde.org/plasma-"
"vault/5e6a53ba55fd60ace3adbd4ca57f90a5cd44992f\">Enmeto.</a> Korektas cimon "
"<a href=\"https://bugs.kde.org/424063\">#424063</a>"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.5.md:11
msgid ""
"Powerdevil: On wakeup from suspend restore remembered keyboard brightness. "
"<a href=\"https://commits.kde.org/powerdevil/"
"e1ed36480cec6a49c166347efba6ab52adc0c37c\">Commit.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Powerdevil: Ĉe vekiĝo de suspendo restarigu memoritan klavaran brilecon. <a "
