"e1ed36480cec6a49c166347efba6ab52adc0c37c\">Enmeto.</a>"

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.5.md:12
msgid ""
"KSysGuard: Correctly handle monitors list changing. <a href=\"https://"
"commits.kde.org/ksysguard/dbb656d54fea47fcb322ffb8e54a3b59ade316fd\">Commit."
"</a>"
