"product=kwin&amp;product=kwrited&amp;product=muon&amp;product=Plasma"
"%20Workspace%20Wallpapers&amp;product=plasma-nm&amp;product=plasmashell&amp;"
"product=Powerdevil&amp;product=solid&amp;product=systemsettings&amp;"
